{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is all about doing everything you can to make your gardening business thrive!</strong> From mowing lawns and trimming hedges to blowing leaves and even sucking up sand. Your job is to get it done, and the customers\u2019 job is to ask. Create your gardening profile, find contracts, complete jobs, earn positive reviews, and unlock more challenging work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mow</strong> lawns in a variety of locations like castles, neighborhoods, huts, parks, mansions, valleys, and more!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122820/extras/b90703541e64af154e095e35fd39d1e4.poster.avif?t=1772405371\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122820/extras/b90703541e64af154e095e35fd39d1e4.webm?t=1772405371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122820/extras/b90703541e64af154e095e35fd39d1e4.mp4?t=1772405371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blow</strong> leaves after mowing and trimming to earn the best possible rewards.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122820/extras/05f4699c40b922c76a324ae1dfd08323.poster.avif?t=1772405371\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122820/extras/05f4699c40b922c76a324ae1dfd08323.webm?t=1772405371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122820/extras/05f4699c40b922c76a324ae1dfd08323.mp4?t